; Merge this section into Data\SKSE\Plugins\higgs_vr.ini.
; Case-insensitive registered client names. Higher priority wins.
; Routed candidates use the assigned executor PROVIDER's priority.
; Missing entries use that client's registered default. Equal scores use the stable
; executor provider ID and then the recognizer ID. One recognizer can rank its own
; offers to that same provider by submitting its preferred offer first.
; Empty Priorities clears overrides. Invalid/duplicate/overflow values preserve
; the previous complete map and log a warning. Up to 64 entries / 8190 characters.
[HandBroker]
Priorities=BodySlots=20,ExampleClimbing=50,ExamplePouchProvider=30
